# Where apt fetches the pinned Ubuntu snapshot from (80-snapshot-mirrors points
# Acquire::Snapshots at this list). Read inside mkosi's sandbox only, never
# installed in the image.
#
# - Index files (InRelease, Packages, Sources...; apt tags them type "index")
#   only ever come from the snapshot: they pin the package set.
# - Packages (type "deb") come from archive.ubuntu.com first, then the snapshot.
#   A pool path names one immutable file, and apt checks every .deb against the
#   SHA256 in the snapshot's own index, so the bytes, the image and RTMR1/RTMR2
#   are the same whichever host served them. This keeps a release building when
#   snapshot.ubuntu.com answers 502/503 for its .debs.
#
# The snapshot id here must equal Snapshot= in mkosi.conf and mkosi.tools.conf;
# build.sh refuses to build when they differ.
https://snapshot.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/20261015T000000Z/	priority:2
http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/	priority:1 type:deb
